@@ -304,6 +304,19 @@ Beside enhancements, VictoriaMetrics also provides the following new actions:
   ([Try it](https://play.victoriametrics.com/select/0/prometheus/graph/#/relabeling?config=-+action%3A+graphite%0A++match%3A+%27*.server.*.total%27%0A++labels%3A%0A++++__name__%3A+%27%24%7B2%7D_total%27%0A++++instance%3A+%27%24%7B2%7D%3A9100%27%0A++++job%3A+%27%241%27&labels=%7B__name__%3D%22app1.server.requests.total%22%7D)).
   See [Graphite Relabeling](#graphite-relabeling) for details.
 
+- **`trim` action**: Strips leading and trailing whitespace from the value of
+  `source_labels` (joined with `separator` if more than one is given) and
+  stores the result at `target_label`. Example: trim whitespace accidentally
+  picked up from a metadata source:
+
+  ```yaml {hl_lines=[1]}
+  - action: trim
+    source_labels: ["foo"]
+    target_label: foo
+  ```
+
+  [Try the above config](https://play.victoriametrics.com/select/0/prometheus/graph/#/relabeling?config=-+action%3A+trim%0A++source_labels%3A+%5B%22foo%22%5D%0A++target_label%3A+foo%0A&labels=%7B__name__%3D%22node_cpu_seconds_total%22%2C+instance%3D%22server-1%3A9100%22%2C+foo%3D%22++bar++%22%7D)
+
 ### Graphite Relabeling
 
